{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wwooyy429/AQRP-LLM/pulls/2","id":5011823840,"node_id":"PR_kwDOVXP_H88AAAABKrpc4A","html_url":"https://github.com/wwooyy429/AQRP-LLM/pull/2","diff_url":"https://github.com/wwooyy429/AQRP-LLM/pull/2.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/wwooyy429/AQRP-LLM/pull/2.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wwooyy429/AQRP-LLM/issues/2","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wwooyy429/AQRP-LLM/pulls/2/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wwooyy429/AQRP-LLM/pulls/2/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wwooyy429/AQRP-LLM/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wwooyy429/AQRP-LLM/issues/2/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wwooyy429/AQRP-LLM/statuses/ea6053e3e9ef4be17db246daf18a4cf9b2e5be58","number":2,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"阶段2：修复WR-20 IPO历史与WR-21派发结算，待独立复审","user":{"login":"wwooyy429","id":80371541,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgwMzcxNTQx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/80371541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwooyy429","html_url":"https://github.com/wwooyy429","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwooyy429/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwooyy429/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwooyy429/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwooyy429/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwooyy429/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwooyy429/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwooyy429/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwooyy429/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwooyy429/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"固定 deb85d9 的独立审核确认两项软件缺陷：新 Research 已有 entry 协议却缺少 dispatch 时，成功回执仍可完成并解锁同父 LEAN（WR-21/P1）；年轻 IPO 可用上市前记录凑足20期历史并通过观测审计（WR-20/P2）。本次修复这两个边界，保留原失败证据及合法兼容路径。**开发修复待新固定版本独立复验，阶段2整体仍未通过。**\n\n## 固定版本与审核入口\n\n- 本次源码：`ea6053e3e9ef4be17db246daf18a4cf9b2e5be58`\n- [GPT Work复审指令及范围](https://github.com/wwooyy429/AQRP-LLM/blob/ea6053e3e9ef4be17db246daf18a4cf9b2e5be58/audit/review_packages/wr20_wr21/README.md)\n- [修复说明](https://github.com/wwooyy429/AQRP-LLM/blob/ea6053e3e9ef4be17db246daf18a4cf9b2e5be58/docs/review/wr20-wr21.md)、[开发验证记录](https://github.com/wwooyy429/AQRP-LLM/blob/ea6053e3e9ef4be17db246daf18a4cf9b2e5be58/audit/review_packages/wr20_wr21/developer_verification.json)\n- [原独立正式报告](https://github.com/wwooyy429/AQRP-LLM/blob/ea6053e3e9ef4be17db246daf18a4cf9b2e5be58/audit/reviews/20261027-deb85d9-windows/formal_report.txt)、[选择性归档校验](https://github.com/wwooyy429/AQRP-LLM/blob/ea6053e3e9ef4be17db246daf18a4cf9b2e5be58/audit/deb85d9_review_archive_check.json)\n- 当前source清单：`e82ee1cce13b020738e37d66b597616f3067e77bdefea99af653d76becf1ee13`\n- 当前稳定execution清单：`faf825ceb25092a14a5864839624a257b297b19f3ab4cd3030c758da21dcaf44`\n\n## 最终修复\n\n- **WR-21：** 有新entry协议的成功、失败和终态重放都要求有效的原dispatch。缺失或损坏在结算写入前拒绝，不能走旧成功路径；核对外层及可选原生cell索引。明确旧无marker任务的兼容恢复保留。\n- **WR-20：** 观测审计的已核对排名视图排除已知上市前记录，19个上市后完整session不具备20期资格，达到20个后才可排名。原批次、引用和计数保持，泛型ingestion旧协议未改变，未知上市证据仍按原规则拒绝。\n- 更新已接受测试夹具，为新协议合成成功先登记派发绑定；首次测试/原审核器错误和修正均保留。\n\n## 实际验证\n\n- `python -B tools/research.py build` 及 `python -B tools/stages.py verify` 成功，**630项合成测试通过**（99.393秒），没有市场访问。\n- [GitHub固定提交离线检查](https://github.com/wwooyy429/AQRP-LLM/actions/runs/40504444358)已完成，Python 3.10及3.11两任务均成功；不能替代独立验收。\n- WR-21专用10方法与相关7套件共108方法通过；未改动原MRE在隔离当前源码上重放通过，合法绑定和旧任务完成，缺绑定/index999拒绝且账本不变。其硬编码deb85d9标签明确按历史标签保留，实际源码哈希另记。\n- WR-20相关30方法、原独立套件13方法/43场景重放通过；原反例非法IPO转为insufficient_evidence，3个合法正控继续通过。第一次时间子例复用不可变存储导致的夹具错误及fresh-store修正已保留。\n- 原真实失败包仅在隔离副本重放：15→17→17，已结算副本17→17→17；缺dispatch和错cell拒绝，无用量变化或成功产物。\n- 上述方法/套件有重叠，不累加为独有测试数；开发者重放独立脚本不等于新独立验收。\n\n原复审ZIP SHA-256为 `19d2614008caf209c18b79e16220826de0394ee9a86f585f32ccce5a9bfd6b49`，12474项登记及12475个ZIP文件均已校验（清单自身解释差额）。Git选择性保留216份原审核文件、用户粘贴原件及明确区分的归档元数据；完整清单、重复源码和其他省略内容仍在原ZIP，不能称本仓库保存了完整包副本。\n\n## 保留的缺口和停止条件\n\n真实云端执行仍为 `7fc5ef2e9d2379d29f48d05a1f3cc760000884d6`，Research原attempt f5d05f5b964b4a1d924e4b70cd207386 已failed。底层来源迭代原因未知；本次没有部署或重跑，新源码不能称云端验证通过。\n\nG1真实成功Research/采集缓存/依赖LEAN链仍缺；G2旧worker实际源码差异仍未知；G3/4的WR21/20修补待独立复验，完整历史US200、财务版本与真实送达/摄入认证仍不足。\n\n真实账本17事件、旧13事件前缀、经济配置、预算及数据暴露均保留。累计配置**7/12**、Research**10/20**、LEAN**1/16**，本次新增市场配置登记/Research/LEAN/模型/部署/购买/交易均0。本轮工程停止条件保持，不授权新轮执行或调整上限。\n\nPR保持草稿、未合并。阶段0/1历史批准按各原SHA和范围保留；阶段3–7未验收。正式因子研究、自动GPT、交易和最终测试关闭；2024–2025已暴露、2026独立性未知，financial_evidence=false。\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-26T04:02:16Z","updated_at":"2026-10-27T12:35:17Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"af54c0c45a61bc8ee1fa6f316cb32dcbc88b8dc6","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"wwooyy429:feat/stage2-data-task-bridge","ref":"feat/stage2-data-task-bridge","repo":{"id":1433665311,"node_id":"R_kgDOVXP_Hw","name":"AQRP-LLM","full_name":"wwooyy429/AQRP-LLM","owner":{"login":"wwooyy429","id":80371541,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgwMzcxNTQx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/80371541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwooyy429","html_url":"https://github.com/wwooyy429","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwooyy429/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwooyy429/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwooyy429/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwooyy429/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwooyy429/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwooyy429/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwooyy429/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwooyy429/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wwooyy429/received_eve